      "effective_style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "結婚式を終えたメロスは、3日目の夜明け前に町へ戻り始めます。帰り道には、橋のない川と、道をふさぐ男たちがいます。川は雨で茶色くなり、流れもとても速くなっています。",
      "status": "OK",
      "z_adoption": "adopted",
      "local_rewrite_diff": null,
      "cooldown_occurred": false,
      "slowdown_applied": null,
      "slowdown_ratio": null,
      "reused": false,
      "duration_seconds": 17.04,
      "cost_jpy": null
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "comment_1",
      "out_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_03/a2/narration/comment_1.wav",
      "derived_segment_id": "comment_1",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "kind": "comment",
      "voice": "Aoede",
      "model_ids_measured": [
        "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
      ],
      "style_label": "S3",
      "style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "effective_style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "メロスは恐怖から人を殺し、話す機会も与えない支配者を責め、死刑を命じられます。妹の結婚式に出るため3日間の猶予を求め、友人を残して出発しますが、遅れて戻れば友人が代わりに死ぬことになっています。",
      "status": "OK",
      "z_adoption": "adopted",
      "local_rewrite_diff": null,
      "cooldown_occurred": false,
      "slowdown_applied": null,
      "slowdown_ratio": null,
      "reused": false,
      "duration_seconds": 19.28,
      "cost_jpy": null
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "comment_2",
      "out_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_03/a2/narration/comment_2.wav",
      "derived_segment_id": "comment_2",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "kind": "comment",
      "voice": "Aoede",
      "model_ids_measured": [
        "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
      ],
      "style_label": "S3",
      "style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "effective_style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "橋のない川を渡り、道を塞いだ三人から逃げた彼は、午後には足が血だらけになり、岩のそばで立てなくなります。彼には、ここで待つか、家へ戻るかの選択が残っています。戻らなければ、友人が代わりに命を失います。",
      "status": "OK",
      "z_adoption": "adopted",
      "local_rewrite_diff": null,
      "cooldown_occurred": false,
      "slowdown_applied": null,
      "slowdown_ratio": null,
      "reused": false,
      "duration_seconds": 20.84,
      "cost_jpy": null
    },
    {
      "clip_id": "comment_3",
      "out_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_03/a2/narration/comment_3.wav",
      "derived_segment_id": "comment_3",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "kind": "comment",
      "voice": "Aoede",
      "model_ids_measured": [
        "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
      ],
      "style_label": "S3",
      "style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "effective_style_prefix_sha256": "060c08fde003cf7c2d15c654da96d3f857b8e7a9bd79eac31814ceaf7c923f33",
      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "メロスは、鎖を受け入れるために差し出された友人の手を思い出します。友人は、もう一度約束を求めずに、彼を信じていました。岩の割れ目から水が少しずつ流れ、メロスはそれを飲んで立ち上がり、一歩ずつ進みます。",
      "status": "OK",
      "z_adoption": "adopted",
      "local_rewrite_diff": null,
      "cooldown_occurred": false,
      "slowdown_applied": null,
      "slowdown_ratio": null,
